# src/

Core datastore implementation for Udex, providing PostgreSQL-backed data persistence with transaction support, configuration management, and entry/index operations. Implements the Datastore trait with full CRUD operations, migration support, and integration testing utilities.

## Files

- `lib.rs` -- Core Datastore trait, error types, and public API surface
- `postgres.rs` -- PostgreSQL implementation of Datastore with transaction-based operations
- `config.rs` -- DatastoreConfig struct and environment variable placeholder resolution
- `integration_test.rs` -- Test database initialization and cleanup helpers using testcontainers pattern
